{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/27520ff314da4e36fe04a1fa183def7b.avif?t=1770218391\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the neon-lit world of TRET, where skill, strategy, and fast-paced action collide in a high-stakes game show like no other! The city is alive with glowing lights, towering skyscrapers, and an audience that never blinks\u2014watching, waiting, anticipating your next move. Every challenger steps onto the grand stage, but only the most daring and skilled will conquer its trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/d6785210f6981aa7ac6361eca049008d.poster.avif?t=1770218391\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/d6785210f6981aa7ac6361eca049008d.webm?t=1770218391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/d6785210f6981aa7ac6361eca049008d.mp4?t=1770218391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate dynamic arenas, overcome deadly hazards, and guide your synthball to victory. Each level is a new puzzle, a fresh test of reflexes and problem-solving, set against the electrifying pulse of a synthwave soundtrack. Are you ready to take the stage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/2720f17f1daa261773d53de13e94b76e.avif?t=1770218391\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/c6e4bdfd36f0b9c8c56efbcef501594a.poster.avif?t=1770218391\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/c6e4bdfd36f0b9c8c56efbcef501594a.webm?t=1770218391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/c6e4bdfd36f0b9c8c56efbcef501594a.mp4?t=1770218391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3D Puzzle-Platformer \u2013 Each level is a blend of physics-based puzzles, movement challenges, and strategic thinking. Speed across platforms, dodge lasers, and use your environment to manipulate your synthball\u2019s path to success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable Characters - Tired of your look? Visit the cloth market between levels and freshen up in style with hundreds of color and style combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 Unique Levels, Each a New Challenge \u2013 Wall-run, leap through moving obstacles, and outsmart the ever-changing arena. No two levels are the same, and each will test your skill, smarts and precision in new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Thrilling Synthwave Spectacle \u2013 Immerse yourself in a world where neon never fades, the city pulses with electric energy, and the soundtrack is a relentless wave of retro-futuristic beats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for Glory \u2013 Whether you're chasing the perfect run or aiming for the top of the global leaderboards, TRET is built for those who live for the thrill of competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/6525f6975b8dcd341b237bc102d4fe89.poster.avif?t=1770218391\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/6525f6975b8dcd341b237bc102d4fe89.webm?t=1770218391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/6525f6975b8dcd341b237bc102d4fe89.mp4?t=1770218391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The lights are on, the stage is set,\u00a0the challenge begins now!</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2492610?t=1770218391","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/442c91c5eb46da548ff85914f74b5f30c35e73b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770218391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/4005354ec41777fd6294c382fa0d22d9ac4977da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770218391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/4005354ec41777fd6294c382fa0d22d9ac4977da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770218391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2492610/extras/27520ff314da4e36fe04a1fa183def7b.avif?t=1770218391\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the neon-lit world of TRET, where skill, strategy, and fast-paced action collide in a high-stakes game show like no other! The city is